    <briefdescription>
<para>Aggregates the growth information of resources for branch terrain cells. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class summarizes the growth of all child resources under a branch terrain cell. It tracks the minimum edible biomass available and allows updating the growth state at the branch level. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
